# Allowlist for scripts/check_influence_map_registry.sh.
#
# Format:
#   <TypeName> <ticket-id>     # rationale
#
# Comments: everything after `#` is ignored.
#
# Each entry MUST cite the ticket that wires the impl into
# `populate_influence_map_registry` (src/plugins/simulation.rs).
# When the work lands, drop the entry; the lint will then enforce
# that the L1 trace surface stays wired. Adding a new entry without
# a ticket id is a code-review failure.
#
# Empty at landing of ticket 207 — every existing `impl InfluenceMap`
# has its registration in `populate_influence_map_registry`.
#
# Parallel precedent: scripts/substrate_stubs.allowlist (mirrors the
# substrate-stub discipline from ticket 160).
